            "value": "Таз высоко, тело — одна плоскость."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hips dropping when the leg lifts — stabilize the plank first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Hüfte sinkt ab, sobald du das Bein hebst – sorg erst für eine stabile Plank."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hips dropping when the leg lifts — stabilize the plank first."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cadera cae al subir la pierna: primero consigue una plancha estable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bassin tombe quand la jambe monte : stabilise d’abord la planche."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il bacino scende quando alzi la gamba – prima stabilizza il plank."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O quadril cai quando a perna sobe: primeiro deixe a prancha estável."
